# AAT.csv

Dataset: seis-tonga — Hunga Tonga 2022 pressure wave (Lamb wave) at 102 US ASOS stations,
  one-minute pressure (IEM)
File: data/seis/tonga/raw/AAT.csv
SHA-256: d8aec47097f08d773ede556ee5880d1846c15cecd12dc0927c13602d1c3ce51b (also in
  data/seis/tonga/inputs.lock; check with: cd data/seis/tonga && sha256sum -c inputs.lock)
In the public repository: no, only this description and the hash: the file may be shared but is kept
  out of git for its size. Get it from fog fetch seis-tonga, then compare its SHA-256 with the one
  above.
Obtained: the answer of a public web API to the request given.
From: Iowa Environmental Mesonet, ASOS one-minute pressure (pres1), 2022-01-15 to 2022-01-18, one
  request per station.
Check it yourself: fog verify seis-tonga (tools/) downloads it again into a temporary directory and
  compares it with this hash.
Collected: 2026-10-03
Licence: other — Iowa Environmental Mesonet (Iowa State University) archive of NWS/FAA ASOS
  one-minute data: open, no account; credit IEM.
Sources:
- Iowa Environmental Mesonet, ASOS one-minute data (pres1), 2022-01-15 to 2022-01-18
  <https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/request/asos/1min.phtml>
- USGS event page: Hunga Tonga-Hunga Ha'apai, 2022-01-15 04:14:45 UTC, 20.546 S 175.390 W
  <https://earthquake.usgs.gov/>
Evidence class (rule 10): measure
What would vindicate the flat model (rule 5): No second arrival sloping the opposite way: the V of
  the outbound (A1) and antipodal (A2) passages is what needs no speed at all (tg-call2).
Built by: fog build seis-tonga
Generated files:
- src/data/presets/seis-tonga.js
- data/seis/tonga/picks.json
- data/seis/tonga/picks.csv
Code:
- tools/internal/build/tonga
- src/tabs/atmo/tongalogic.js
- src/tabs/atmo/lambpool.js
Shown on the page:
- #tab-atmo/tg-h1
- #tab-atmo/lp-h1
Notes: The picks use no Earth model (wide windows that do not encode the answer); the angle from the
  vent comes after. Two stations per state, the first online ones with an archive begun before 2000,
  in IEM's order. The verdict rule is paraphrased from the page's callout tg-call2.

Written by `fog build explain` from data/seis/tonga/dataset.json and data/seis/tonga/inputs.lock: edit those, not this file.
